Helm chart：貼一個 HelmChart 資源的 YAML 就會裝（k3s 內建 Helm 控制器），例如：\napiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\nkind: HelmChart\nmetadata: {name: wordpress, namespace: kube-system}\nspec: {repo: https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami, chart: wordpress, targetNamespace: web, createNamespace: true}	Chart Helm : collez le YAML d'une ressource HelmChart pour l'installer (k3s intègre un contrôleur Helm), par exemple :\napiVersion: helm.cattle.io/v1\nkind: HelmChart\nmetadata: {name: wordpress, namespace: kube-system}\nspec: {repo: https://charts.bitnami.com/bitnami, chart: wordpress, targetNamespace: web, createNamespace: true}
